&lt;h2 class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/KFZ3OzvxybE?feature=shared&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
Products are the core of our business. We aim to offer the best product range, to make sure we always deliver the best quality. As Buyer, you&#39;re responsible to do this for your category. With your team you take full responsibility for your category, with the goal to make customers happy and improve profitability. Picnic is data-driven and complex - from pricing strategies, forecasting, warehouse automation, to the ever-expanding growth of our company, we are constantly faced with new challenges and opportunities…that’s where you come in! &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are on the hunt for an ambitious buyer with superb category management and negotiations skills while building lasting relationships with suppliers. You also offer entrepreneurial, realistic, and practical business opportunities. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have a forward-thinking idea? Tell your team, modify it, evaluate, experiment, and then make a real impact in our company!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-5&quot; data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;e4ce408e-2838-43f1-a4ba-78c9969e7973&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-4o&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiation strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Define clear negotiation strategies to ensure competitive conditions with our suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier negotiations:&lt;/strong&gt; Run negotiations with many suppliers from start until signed contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and develop a deep understanding of your category through a combination of Picnic data, customer insights and supplier input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep an eye open for commercial opportunities and use a data-first approach to identify category innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category improvements:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and execute a pragmatic plan to drive the category improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply chain:&lt;/strong&gt; Understand the end-to-end supply chain and identify opportunities to improve the range, product quality and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work together with your category team to bring the best to our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc degree with exposure to analytical problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of work experience, preferably as (junior) category manager and/or buyer in a commercial and analytical environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial drive, a nose for opportunities and not afraid to negotiate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persistence and enthusiasm to drive projects to a successful end result&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive to deal with day-to-day operations, swift problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for food and/or consumer products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English (Dutch, German or French is a plus!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: This is not a one-time hire. We’re hiring for this role throughout the year as part of our ongoing growth and expansion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
