&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll be supporting the Commercial team responsible for shaping the product assortment that puts a smile on our customers’ faces 😊. As a Commercial Working Student, you’ll have the opportunity to contribute in one of several of our core teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate closely with category managers, suppliers, buyers, and creatives to gain a well-rounded view of the Commercial team and how different functions work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assortment Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Support in analyzing assortment strategies to help ensure our product range is data-driven, relevant, and tailored to customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in product tastings and sourcing efforts to contribute to the selection of top-quality items at the best prices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Sourcing:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with international partners and teams to help identify new sourcing opportunities and support cross-border collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Get practical experience in a fast-paced, data-driven environment where ownership, curiosity, and learning by doing are key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Student in the last year of your Bachelor (HBO or WO) or Master (WO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education in a relevant field; Business Administration, Economics, Business Information, Food Sciences or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for at least 6 months&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available a minimum of 3 days p/w&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, independent, detail-oriented with a proactive mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and preferably in Dutch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;You’ll receive a gross hourly wage of €16,75 (all inclusive), along with a laptop to support your work. Travel costs can also be reimbursed, depending on your location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we run some of Europe’s most advanced automated grocery fulfilment centres, combining robotics, smart software, and a people-first culture. As a Continuous Improvement and Value Stream Operations Manager, you own a key part of the operation, leading multiple teams across shifts to deliver on safety, quality, productivity, and continuous improvement. You work closely with the Site Manager and other Operations managers to turn site goals into daily action, develop strong operational leaders, and help build a high-performing, scalable operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our site in Dordrecht operates at high volume with a team of around 500 colleagues, giving you the opportunity to lead in a complex, automated fulfilment environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Take full responsibility for the long-term performance and KPI roadmap of your value stream, defining strategy and driving structural improvements in safety, quality, and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the value stream day to day, coaching supervisors to effectively lead their captain teams, strengthening indirect leadership while ensuring performance targets are met.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze workflows, identify bottlenecks, and implement improvements that increase efficiency, flow, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead daily Kaizen and improvement initiatives, embedding a culture of operational excellence and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Standards and Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a clean, organized, and safe environment, applying 5S principles and reinforcing consistent standards across your teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with maintenance, engineering, planning, analysts, and last-mile teams to ensure seamless end-to-end operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;University degree in Supply Chain, Engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years leadership experience, preferably in warehouse or automated operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in automated or semi-automated fulfilment environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean and continuous improvement experience in complex operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing high-volume, high-SKU workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead teams of leaders and drive results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with a high level of competence in data analysis tools such as Tableau and Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to occasionally step into operational shifts to stay close to the operation and support the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;English and Dutch&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Flexibility: &lt;/strong&gt;We have automated sites throughout the Netherlands in the following locations; Utrecht, Dordrecht and Ridderkerk. During your application we will consider together which site makes most sense for you to begin your journey at Picnic. We are a fast-paced, growing company and due to this we require location flexibility from our Operations team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a competitive compensation package, including 25 vacation days per year to recharge your batteries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The option to lease a car&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy breakfast, lunches (and dinner at the FC) as well as delicious snacks and drinks available at all Picnic locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible company pension plan called “Doenpensioen” at a.s.r.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Picnic laptop and smartphone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An awesome scale-up atmosphere with the freedom to drive your own projects and the opportunity to have an impact!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to work in an international environment with motivated team members &amp;amp; legendary company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Many internal learning and development possibilities as well as professional soft skill &amp;amp; leadership trainings at a specialized external party&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have Fulfilment Centres across The Netherlands in the following locations: Utrecht, Ridderkerk, Berkel en Rodenrijs, Dordrecht, Eindhoven, Zwolle, Heerenveen, Geldermalsen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

