&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Application&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate across the Netherlands with sites in Utrecht, Eindhoven, Rotterdam, Heerenveen, Zwolle, Nijmegen, and Geldermalsen. We are always looking for top talent to strengthen our operations team. If you want to join Picnic but don&#39;t see an open Continuous Improvement and Operations Manager vacancy in your preferred location, please submit an open application here to join our talent pool. Our recruiting team regularly reviews candidates in this pipeline and will reach out as soon as a matching role opens up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Operations Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;at Picnic, you establish stable, high-performance processes and continuously improve them using data and clear KPIs. You own the day-to-day performance of your area, lead multiple shifts and teams, and translate analysis into concrete actions that improve safety, quality, and productivity. Through hands-on leadership and strong process discipline, you turn insights into consistent execution on the floor.​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead daily operations: &lt;/strong&gt;Supervise 1 shift on the floor each week, and use insight to drive process improvements and operational excellence​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Area ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Own day-to-day and weekly performance of your area (inbound or outbound), delivering on safety, quality, productivity, and delivery KPIs.​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead teams across multiple shifts, driving engagement, retention, and strong captain leadership on the floor. ​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident &amp;amp; Planning Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Handle major incidents, set productivity inputs, and manage planning escalations when needed.​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead improvement initiatives and support Lean activities that remove friction from daily operations. ​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive shift-level results on delivery capacity, UPH, cost, completeness, timeliness, and perfect deliveries.​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
