&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En bref&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Picnic, nous réinventons la façon dont les familles font leurs courses, grâce à un service innovant et durable disponible via une application. On recherche un·e Junior Copy Editor ultra-réactif·ve et perfectionniste pour booster nos équipes Contenu et Produit. Dans ce rôle, tu seras à la base de notre tonalité de marque: ta mission sera de garantir que chaque mot sur notre app et notre site soit non seulement impeccable, mais aussi percutant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons quelqu&#39;un pour nous rejoindre en CDI sur notre bureau parisien.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/8dWnhYmGGnI?si=9xx53lq8fMBC_Eon&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prépare-toi à être au cœur de l&#39;action ! Tu accompagneras le flux constant de contenus qui partent en ligne chaque semaine: des newsletters aux recettes qui donnent l’eau à la bouche, en passant par nos pages web et nos descriptions de produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Véritable pivot de l&#39;équipe Copywriting, tu travailleras main dans la main avec notre Lead Copywriter et nos équipes Business, Recettes et Produits pour créer une expérience utilisateur fluide, précise et, surtout, irrésistible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 ans d’expérience minimum en conception-rédaction publicitaire, idéalement pour des marques B2C ou e-commerce. Des profils plus seniors peuvent aussi s’épanouir dans ce rôle s’ils recherchent un poste plus opérationnel et moins orienté gestion de projets ou visibilité externe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un BAC +3/5 en marketing, publicité, communication ou tout autre domaine similaire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une plume persuasive, précise et adaptable à chaque support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un œil affûté pour les détails et les fautes! 😉&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un esprit curieux, structuré, créatif et orienté performances et conversion clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une vraie capacité à jongler entre projets et priorités.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un excellent niveau de français… et d’anglais courant pour échanger facilement avec vos collègues internationaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages Picnic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍴 Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comme nous sommes implantés au centre de Paris, pas de cantine sur place. Par contre, des tickets restaurant d’une valeur de 11€ par jour sont remis afin de tester tous les délicieux restaurants du coin. Notre petite cuisine est également équipée de savoureux en-cas et rafraîchissements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Santé et transports&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec SideCare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, si tu te rends au travail en transports en commun, nous te remboursons ton abonnement à hauteur de 50%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✍️ Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l’opportunité de développer tes compétences, non seulement au travers de projets stimulants, mais aussi grâce à un environnement dynamique, jeune et international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👛 Avantages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un accès à des offres et avantages exclusifs via notre CSE et partenaire Swile (bons d&#39;achats, places de concert, cinéma, et plus encore)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Merci de soumettre ton CV et portfolio en anglais. La lettre de motivation doit être soumise en français, idéalement suivie de sa traduction anglaise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In een notendop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picnic is een van de snelst groeiende bedrijven van Nederland. Als moderne melkboer maken we elke dag duizenden klanten blij met de boodschappen. Die bezorgen we gratis thuis, in onze elektrische wagentjes en met een grote glimlach. Die glimlach zie je niet alleen aan de deur, maar ook in al onze teksten. En voor dat laatste hebben we jou nodig!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Het allerbelangrijkste in onze app zijn onze recepten en natuurlijk de producten. Klanten bestellen hun boodschappen online en kunnen de verpakking niet zelf even vasthouden voordat ze iets kopen. Daarom is het belangrijk dat alle productinformatie in onze app 100% klopt én prettig geschreven is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;De kunst van het vak&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Productbeschrijvingen&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;pushberichten&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SEO-teksten&lt;/strong&gt;: je schakelt moeiteloos en vindt de juiste woorden voor elk kanaal.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Productpresentatie in de app:&lt;/strong&gt; Met onze category managers bedenk je hoe we nieuwe en bestaande producten in ons assortiment het best kunnen presenteren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Redactie: &lt;/strong&gt;Je redigeert input van leveranciers en bepaalt welke info belangrijk is voor onze klanten en welke niet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Receptbeschrijvingen: &lt;/strong&gt;Je zorgt dat onze recepten net zo lekker klinken als ze smaken!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Over jou&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 jaar ervaring en een achtergrond in journalistiek, marketing, media of communicatie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je schrijft perfect Nederlands en weet wat er mis is met “hij wilt” of “bananen brood”. En je Engels is al net zo goed. Wel zo handig voor een praatje bij het koffieapparaat met je internationale collega’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je werkt nauwkeurig, hebt oog voor detial en geniet ervan om aan een zin te sleutelen tot-ie precíes klopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt je goed verplaatsen in anderen en snapt welke informatie belangrijk is op welk moment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je vindt het leuk om zelfstandig te schrijven, maar werkt ook graag samen met collega’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent leergierig, creatief en niet bang om vragen te stellen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spreek je ook een beetje Duits of Frans? Handig!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗 Verse lunch, koffie en snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Op kantoor hebben we een koffiebar met eigen barista&#39;s, chefs die dagelijks een heerlijke, verse lunch bereiden en snacks en fruit zodat je energie op pijl blijft!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️ Korting op zorgverzekering &amp;amp; fietsenplan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We werken samen met zorgverzekeraar CZ, waardoor Picnic-medewerkers een korting van 5% tot 15% krijgen op CZ-verzekeringspakketten. Bovendien kun je via onze samenwerking met Lease a Bike voordelig een nieuwe (e-)fiets leasen, die je later zelfs kunt overnemen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je alle ruimte om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen. Werk je liever aan je mentale welzijn? Via OpenUp krijg je gratis toegang tot professionele psychologen en diverse trainingen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En verder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je 25 vakantiedagen, een vergoeding voor je reiskosten en een pensioenregeling. Ook zorgen we voor een telefoon en laptop!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, the customer engagement and loyalty within the domain in online groceries is unprecedented. This gives us unique opportunities to shape meaningful communications and build lasting relationships with our customers. The Consumer team is responsible for doing just that: telling Picnic&#39;s story and for building meaningful relationships with Picnic&#39;s customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Creative Designer, you will join a team of designers, analysts, communication coordinators, store managers and copywriters from the start of a communication initiative until we reach our customers&#39; doors. Our goal is to design the most engaging campaigns that directly speak to (potential) customers &amp;amp; and ensure all our assets across multiple channels are in line with our brand. You will think along with the design briefs, develop campaign visuals and help shaping Picnic’s visual identity. Each project, we aim to learn more about our customers and become better at shaping our communications to their needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note: this is not a UX/UI design job.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build engaging campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with business stakeholders to build campaigns that engage our existing/future customers. From original concept to final asset creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly visual design work: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and update email campaigns, social media assets, online ads and campaign visuals for our app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Picnic&#39;s visual identity:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure brand consistency across multiple channels and help shape the future of our visual identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop a design analytical approach:&lt;/strong&gt; Adopt an overall analytical approach to design by testing and validating your designs either through user test or A/B testing online&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-team &amp;amp; cross-country collaborations:&lt;/strong&gt; Work and learn from experienced designers, analysts and business stakeholders internationally (the Netherlands, Germany &amp;amp; France)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trend research &amp;amp; knowledge sharing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Research retail trends and conduct competitor reviews to keep the team up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in a relevant graphical/visual/communication design field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 years of working experience in visual design, preferably in a commercial and/or agency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid online portfolio showing a keen eye for detail paired with lots of creative flair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert with Adobe Suite (Photoshop and Illustrator) and Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with a “roll up your sleeves” attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affinity for illustration and experience with animation are a plus but not a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English skills on point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏠 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the ultimate spider in the web who thrives in a fast-paced, creative environment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we deliver groceries to thousands of households every week. But behind every flawless delivery is a massive operation of creating and improving products. With over 3,000 private label articles, continuous improvements to recipes, and innovative designs, we handle a high volume of packaging updates as well as many new innovative product launches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need someone to be the central hub between our teams—someone who can chase people down when needed so we can keep to strict deadlines, ensure seamless product transitions, and maintain quick launch times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Design Coordinator, you are at the heart of our private label packaging process. Your mission is to keep the engine running smoothly. Your key responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-team collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely together with category managers, the design team, and suppliers to ensure seamless switches of packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Plan design capacity based on upcoming product launches and dare to adjust planning based on shifting urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; compliance control:&lt;/strong&gt; Help check the designs to ensure all changes are correctly applied and strictly adhere to relevant packaging laws and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a sharp eye for packaging aesthetics, ensuring all final artwork meets high visual standards while remaining brand-aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fierce accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; Dare to challenge stakeholders if they are not keeping to their deadlines or not providing complete documentation to start projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure all stakeholders are kept up to date on timings, planning, and deadlines at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 2 years of experience, preferably in a project management or coordination role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a natural spider in the web, easily connecting different teams and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are super structured and thrive in environments with many moving parts and strict deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can stand your ground and confidently challenge people when they are not sticking to agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a great communicator who combines organizational skills with a proactive, &quot;get-it-done&quot; mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English; fluency in Dutch is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏠 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Designer Working Student to help bring Picnic’s people, culture and opportunities to life. You’ll join our Employer Branding team and help shape how candidates experience Picnic, with a particular focus on our LinkedIn page and campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll create and edit visual content for our employer brand, combining design and video to tell stories that catch people’s attention. You’ll also take ownership of the processes behind our LinkedIn campaigns: helping plan content, coordinate assets, publish posts and keep campaigns running smoothly. From a first idea to the final edit and post, you’ll help make sure our content feels distinctive, engaging and true to Picnic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with colleagues across Employer Branding and our wider Creative team of 20+ specialists, including designers, videographers and copywriters. Together, you’ll make content that reaches candidates across the Netherlands, France and Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create employer brand content:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and edit visuals and videos for Picnic’s LinkedIn page, campaigns and other employer branding channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own LinkedIn campaign processes:&lt;/strong&gt; Help plan campaign content, coordinate the assets and timelines, publish posts and keep the process organised from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring stories to life:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn ideas, interviews and raw footage into clear, engaging content that shows what it’s like to work at Picnic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adapt content for different formats:&lt;/strong&gt; Resize and refine designs and edits for different channels and placements, while keeping the look and message consistent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support the creative process:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Employer Branding and Creative colleagues to develop ideas, gather feedback and deliver content on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and improve:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep an eye on how content performs and use what you learn to help improve future posts and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re currently studying Visual Design, Graphic Design, Communication, Media, or a similar creative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited by both visual design and video editing, and keen to work across formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a portfolio or examples of your creative work that show a good eye for detail and a feel for visual storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with, or are keen to develop your skills in, tools such as Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Premiere Pro and After Effects. Familiarity with Figma is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re organised and comfortable taking ownership of a process, managing details and following through on deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re proactive, open to feedback and happy to roll up your sleeves in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English (Dutch, French or German are a plus!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll receive a gross hourly wage of €16.75, along with a laptop to support your work. Travel costs can also be reimbursed, depending on your location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about Learning &amp;amp; Development and delivering smooth digital learning experiences at scale? Join our L&amp;amp;D team at Amsterdam HQ as our Digital Learning Administrator! At Picnic, we are revolutionizing the grocery industry with our innovative, app-only service. As the technical backbone of our digital learning infrastructure, you will ensure our 20,000+ operational employees and 500+ leaders have seamless, secure, and reliable access to the training they need. You’ll keep our LMS (the Picnic Academy) running like clockwork while creating engaging content and supporting platform innovation to optimize learner experience across all markets (the Netherlands, Germany, and France).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintains learning platform and innovates for optimal learner experience (70%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access &amp;amp; permissions:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage user access integrations (partnering with Tech teams) to guarantee smooth onboarding, role-based access, and automated content triggers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain a scalable content library with clear naming conventions and version control across languages to prevent content clutter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical maintenance &amp;amp; security:&lt;/strong&gt; Resolve open tech support tickets, serve as primary point of contact for the LMS provider, and handle bug escalation processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain (Tableau) dashboards to track completion rates, deliver periodic stakeholder reporting, and translate learning data into actionable business insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-service &amp;amp; enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Empower the wider L&amp;amp;D team and operational stakeholders through practical training, toolkits, and hands-on guidance to manage basic LMS operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement new platform initiatives to improve the learner experience and automate system processes to reduce manual labor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Updates &amp;amp; creates digital content (30%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead small projects for engaging digital content creation in close collaboration with operational colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform updates:&lt;/strong&gt; Upload, test, and publish updated content, assets, and learning paths, ensuring a seamless learning experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
