&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Picnic’s Digital PR Specialist, you will lead our efforts to become one of the most visible, talk-about and authoritative brands in the online grocery sector. Your mission is to craft compelling narratives, data-driven insights, and creative campaigns that spark online conversations and are recognized as authoritative by journalists, digital publishers, and AI-driven search platforms.&amp;nbsp;Working alongside our SEO/GEO, data, and brand experts, you’ll transform our innovations into earned media coverage and sustainable organic growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In short: you ensure Picnic is impossible to ignore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create stories that travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Find compelling stories in Picnic’s customer insights, products, data, and business. Turn consumer trends, cultural moments and original&amp;nbsp;research into campaigns that earn coverage, links, and conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Earn high-quality coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Build relationships with journalists, editors, publishers, creators, and other influential voices. Pitch relevant stories across national, regional, consumer, business, and specialist media, positioning Picnic as a trusted source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build organic authority:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with SEO to earn authoritative backlinks, brand mentions, and citations. Identify topics Picnic can credibly own and create evergreen assets that strengthen visibility over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use data as PR engines:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Data and Research teams to uncover insights and turn them into clear, newsworthy stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore how Digital PR can strengthen Picnic’s presence in AI answers and recommendations. Experiment continuously with new tools and approaches as media and search evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure meaningful impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Track coverage quality, backlinks, brand mentions, share of voice, organic traffic, and visibility across search and AI platforms. Connect Digital PR activity to broader brand and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Communications, Journalism, Marketing, or Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native Dutch speaker and fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in Digital PR, communications, journalism, or organic growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with consumer brands, grocery and retail brands is a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of creating stories that earn meaningful media coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen eye on what makes something genuinely newsworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SEO and the value of authoritative backlinks, mentions, and citations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with data and turning analysis into compelling stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing and storytelling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast, creative, analytical, and comfortable experimenting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of generative search / AI visibility and emerging GEO practices is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Google Search Console, Semrush, or similar SEO tools is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of generative search / AI visibility and emerging GEO practices is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
