&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curious, mature, and confident to coach and intervene&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong people and process focus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on, flexible and getting things done mentality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Result-driven, happily chasing outputs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An incredible drive to disrupt the world of grocery shopping&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
