&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-assistant-stream-block=&quot;&quot; data-assistant-stream-block-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;As a Maintenance&amp;nbsp;Supervisor at one&amp;nbsp;of our automated&amp;nbsp;fulfilment centers in&amp;nbsp;Ridderkerk, you will&amp;nbsp;ensure that our&amp;nbsp;technical installations&amp;nbsp;operate safely, reliably, and at peak&amp;nbsp;performance. Together with&amp;nbsp;your team of&amp;nbsp;Shift Technicians, you&amp;nbsp;will contribute to&amp;nbsp;a smooth-running&amp;nbsp;24/7 operation&amp;nbsp;and a safe, clean, and well-organized working environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-assistant-stream-block=&quot;&quot; data-assistant-stream-block-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You are the&amp;nbsp;key link between&amp;nbsp;your Maintenance team&amp;nbsp;and Operations. During&amp;nbsp;your shift, you&amp;nbsp;set priorities, coach&amp;nbsp;technicians in their&amp;nbsp;development, and act&amp;nbsp;as the first&amp;nbsp;point of contact&amp;nbsp;for critical breakdowns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-assistant-stream-block=&quot;&quot; data-assistant-stream-block-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Ready to keep&amp;nbsp;our operation running&amp;nbsp;smoothly together with&amp;nbsp;your team? Then&amp;nbsp;read on!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; coach your team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Provide daily leadership to all Shift Technicians working in a 24/7 environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure safety &amp;amp; structure:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Keep the workshop and working environment safe, clean, and well organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage maintenance operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Monitor the planning, progress, and quality of the maintenance plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team management &amp;amp; performance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage workforce planning and support the development of all Technicians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage critical breakdowns:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ensure Technicians set the right priorities and maintain effective collaboration with Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive continuous improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Identify opportunities for improvement and promote Lean, 5S, and data-driven maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coordinate daily with Operations, Engineers, and external maintenance partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an &lt;strong&gt;MBO-4 or HBO degree&lt;/strong&gt; in Mechanical Engineering, Mechatronics, or a similar technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;10+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a technical or maintenance environment, preferably within an automated, logistics, or manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least &lt;strong&gt;3 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; as a Lead, Team Lead, Supervisor, or in a similar leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;practical, hands-on mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and understand both the technical and operational aspects of maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with &lt;strong&gt;CMMS or EAM systems&lt;/strong&gt;; knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;ICS/SCADA tools&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on your experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day shifts&lt;/strong&gt;; 9-5 schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company car&lt;/strong&gt;, or a travel allowance of €0.21 per km, starting from 10 km one-way;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25 vacation days&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension contributions from day one&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training programs&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to further develop your technical skills and logistics knowledge;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free meals &amp;amp; snacks&lt;/strong&gt; at the warehouse;&lt;/li&gt;
