&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;What’s it like to revolutionize HR at the fastest-growing online supermarket app in Europe? At Picnic, we’ve reinvented grocery delivery, and our People team is doing the exact same thing for how teams grow, scale, and thrive!&amp;nbsp;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;People Partner&lt;/strong&gt;, you aren&#39;t an advisor sitting on the sidelines. You&#39;re embedded right where the action happens. Partnering with a business unit of ~75 Picnic-ers across our central hubs in Amsterdam, Paris, and Düsseldorf, you’ll take end-to-end ownership of your team’s organizational strategy, from talent development and high-performance coaching to scaling team structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Performance management:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive performance and talent across your team by conducting regular check-ins, bi-annual reviews, and performance calibrations with employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;People management:&lt;/strong&gt; Be a trusted advisor and coach to the leadership team, playing a critical role in enhancing leadership effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
