&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What’s it like to revolutionize HR at the fastest-growing online supermarket app in Europe? At Picnic, we’ve reinvented grocery delivery, and our People team is doing the exact same thing for how teams grow, scale, and thrive! As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;232&quot;&gt;People Partner - Tech&lt;/strong&gt;, you aren&#39;t an advisor sitting on the sidelines. You&#39;re embedded right where the action happens. Partnering directly with ~75 Picnic-ers in our Tech domain, including Software Engineers, Product Owners, and Data Engineers, across our central hubs in Amsterdam, Paris, and Düsseldorf, you’ll take end-to-end ownership of your team’s organizational strategy, from talent development and high-performance coaching to scaling tech team structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Performance management:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive performance and talent across your tech domain by conducting regular check-ins, bi-annual reviews, and performance calibrations with employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;People management:&lt;/strong&gt; Be a trusted advisor and coach to the tech leadership team, playing a critical role in enhancing leadership effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Staffing &amp;amp; Talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage tech talent dynamically to ensure the right engineers and product leaders are in the right roles at every stage of growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Project management:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive impactful people-related initiatives, leveraging data-driven insights to guide decision-making and deliver proactive solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Continuous improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, challenge, and continuously refine core tech people programs, including staffing, onboarding, learning &amp;amp; development, and rotation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with tech business leaders to cultivate and enable a strong, effective leadership pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Ops:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain operational rigor by handling all administrative-related tasks around development agreements, contracts, and compensation structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
