&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picnic is looking for an SEO Specialist who&#39;s passionate about optimizing websites for better search performance, understands the complexity of technical SEO, and has the drive to implement impactful changes. If you enjoy working in an international team and are excited to grow the Picnic website to our main customer acquisition channel, we’d love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch SEO strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and execute SEO strategies tailored to increase organic traffic and improve search engine rankings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO research:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct in-depth keyword research to identify opportunities and ensure content is optimized for search intent and relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyze and enhance the technical aspects of our website, including site architecture, crawlability, indexability, and page speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with web developers and UX/UI designers to implement technical SEO changes and ensure website best practices are followed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with the content team to optimize &amp;amp; implement content for search engines while maintaining brand tone and user engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance monitoring: &lt;/strong&gt;Utilize SEO tools to monitor performance, track keyword rankings, analyze backlinks, and identify improvement areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide regular reports on organic search performance and recommend strategies for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc. degree in Marketing, Business Administration, Analytics or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 2 years of experience as SEO Specialist in an international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of technical SEO, including site architecture, crawl management, structured data, and mobile-first indexing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SEO tools such as Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush and Screaming Frog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make and implement technical changes directly on websites (experience with Content Management Systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in either Dutch, German or French is required, next to fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to interpret complex data, identify trends, and apply them to SEO strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork skills to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams, including developers, designers, and content creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with a keen eye for detail and a passion for improving website performance and user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏠 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;10yxk9z&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;In een notendop&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;16&quot; data-end=&quot;436&quot;&gt;Picnic is op zoek naar een SEO Specialist met een passie voor het optimaliseren van websites voor betere vindbaarheid in zoekmachines. Je begrijpt de complexiteit van technische SEO en hebt de drive om impactvolle verbeteringen door te voeren. Werk je graag in een internationaal team en krijg je energie van het laten groeien van de Picnic-website tot hét belangrijkste customer acquisition kanaal? Lees dan snel verder!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;10yxk9z&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;Kunst van het vak&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;30fy0l&quot; data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;628&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;464&quot; data-end=&quot;496&quot;&gt;SEO-strategieën ontwikkelen:&lt;/strong&gt; Ontwikkel en implementeer SEO-strategieën gericht op het vergroten van organisch verkeer en het verbeteren van zoekmachineposities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mmgn5y&quot; data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;793&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;SEO-onderzoek:&lt;/strong&gt; Voer diepgaand keyword research uit om kansen te identificeren en ervoor te zorgen dat content optimaal aansluit op zoekintentie en relevantie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gpzsvu&quot; data-start=&quot;794&quot; data-end=&quot;964&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;Technische SEO-optimalisatie:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyseer en verbeter de technische aspecten van onze website, zoals sitestructuur, crawlbaarheid, indexeerbaarheid en paginasnelheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h8grj4&quot; data-start=&quot;965&quot; data-end=&quot;1142&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;967&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;Nauwe samenwerking:&lt;/strong&gt; Werk intensief samen met webdevelopers en UX/UI-designers om technische SEO-verbeteringen door te voeren en best practices voor websites te waarborgen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d70vk6&quot; data-start=&quot;1143&quot; data-end=&quot;1327&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;Contentoptimalisatie:&lt;/strong&gt; Werk samen met het contentteam om content te optimaliseren en implementeren voor zoekmachines, zonder concessies te doen aan merktoon en gebruikerservaring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;syg1b8&quot; data-start=&quot;1328&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1330&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;Performance monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Gebruik SEO-tools om prestaties te monitoren, keyword rankings te volgen, backlinks te analyseren en verbeterkansen te signaleren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14cnp8b&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1506&quot;&gt;Rapportage:&lt;/strong&gt; Stel regelmatig rapportages op over organische zoekprestaties en adviseer over optimalisatiestrategieën.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1tfla33&quot; data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;Jouw superkrachten&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;2617&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u5nfnb&quot; data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1710&quot;&gt;Afgeronde MSc. opleiding in Marketing, Bedrijfskunde, Analytics of vergelijkbaar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qxwo9p&quot; data-start=&quot;1711&quot; data-end=&quot;1784&quot;&gt;Tot 2 jaar ervaring als SEO Specialist binnen een customer-facing merk en internationale omgeving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y799c2&quot; data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;Diepgaande kennis van technische SEO, waaronder sitestructuur, crawl management, structured data en mobile-first indexing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mzaapm&quot; data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;2015&quot;&gt;Hands-on ervaring met SEO-tools zoals Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush en Screaming Frog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gsspkt&quot; data-start=&quot;2016&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;Vermogen om technische wijzigingen zelfstandig op websites door te voeren (ervaring met CMS-systemen)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g2tstw&quot; data-start=&quot;2120&quot; data-end=&quot;2198&quot;&gt;Vloeiend in Nederlands en Engels; kennis van Frans of Duits is een grote pré&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qdobbq&quot; data-start=&quot;2199&quot; data-end=&quot;2351&quot;&gt;Sterke analytische vaardigheden en het vermogen om complexe data te interpreteren, trends te signaleren en te vertalen naar effectieve SEO-strategieën&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13slj5f&quot; data-start=&quot;2352&quot; data-end=&quot;2514&quot;&gt;Uitstekende communicatieve en samenwerkingsvaardigheden om effectief te werken met multidisciplinaire teams, waaronder developers, designers en content creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;175q3ce&quot; data-start=&quot;2515&quot; data-end=&quot;2617&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Zelfstandig, nauwkeurig en gedreven om websiteprestaties en gebruikerservaring continu te verbeteren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Verse lunch, koffie en snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Op kantoor hebben we een koffiebar met eigen barista&#39;s, chefs die dagelijks een heerlijke, verse lunch bereiden en snacks en fruit zodat je energie op peil blijft!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚵🏼 Korting op zorgverzekering &amp;amp; fietsenplan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We werken samen met zorgverzekeraar CZ, waardoor Picnic-medewerkers een korting van 5% tot 15% krijgen op CZ-verzekeringspakketten. Bovendien kun je via onze samenwerking met Lease a Bike voordelig een nieuwe (e-)fiets leasen, die je later zelfs kunt overnemen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je alle ruimte om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen. We bieden persoonlijke groeikansen met Lepaya-cursussen, Academy-trainingen en meer. Werk je liever aan je mentale welzijn? Via OpenUp krijg je gratis toegang tot professionele psychologen en diverse trainingen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En verder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je 25 vakantiedagen, een vergoeding voor je reiskosten en een pensioenregeling. Ook zorgen we voor een telefoon en laptop!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Service Designer at Picnic, you’ll shape how millions of families experience grocery shopping, from planning their groceries and weekly meals to cooking and enjoying healthy, delicious food together. You’ll work hand in hand with Product Owners, Designers, UX Researchers, Data Analysts, Engineers, and Business stakeholders to design every step of the customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll spend half your time running service design and research activities such as customer interviews, journey mapping, and usability testing. The other half you’ll focus on turning those insights into solutions that drive real customer impact. By bringing everyone at Picnic closer to our customers, you’ll help create innovations that make everyday life simpler, healthier, and more sustainable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service design:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the end-to-end customer experience and build deep customer understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; exploring:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop, test, and refine new concepts that drive product and service initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with designers and other teams to prototype and evaluate solutions every week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Document research, present actionable insights to guide decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer focus: &lt;/strong&gt;Be the face of Picnic and engage with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Strive for continuous improvement to take our UX team to the next level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc. degree in a relevant field, such as Industrial Design, Human Computer Interaction Design or Product Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0-4 years of experience as Service Designer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing end-to-end product thinking, solving real problems for real people at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conceptual-analytical skills: able to understand complex flows, connect business and technical perspectives, and translate data into clear insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to reason on high level about various topics, to quickly understand and discuss both business and technical concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator: You know how to facilitate workshops with anyone and know how to present service insights succinctly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility: Agile approach and ability to learn on the go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creativity: Outside-the box thinking and passion for details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affinity for or previous experience with digital design is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both Dutch and English. German and/or French are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open and available to work on-site fulltime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Kurz und knapp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei Picnic betreiben wir einige der modernsten automatisierten Lebensmittel-Fulfillment-Center Europas - mit einer Mischung aus Robotik, smarter Software und einer People-First-Kultur. Mit über 3.000 EPVs (Electric Picnic Vehicle) liefern wir in über 100 deutschen Städten täglich Lebensmittel aus. Unsere jüngste Investment Runde, an der auch die Bill &amp;amp; Melinda Gates Foundation beteiligt ist, zeigt das Vertrauen in unser Konzept.&amp;nbsp;Als Site Manager (m/w/d) spielst du eine entscheidende Rolle bei der Sicherstellung der Zufriedenheit unserer Kunden und Mitarbeitenden.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
