&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a Master’s Degree (in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Information Technology, Computer Engineering or a related technical field) or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 2-5 years of professional experience with Java.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a product mindset and treat technology as a means to an end, owning and solving business problems by choosing the best-fitting technical solutions and tools for each challenge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with AI tooling and are comfortable with agentic engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
