&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Analyst Intern at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This role is all about driving impact—you’ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that push boundaries and redefine the grocery shopping experience. You’ll join a dynamic and collaborative team in a fast-paced, innovative environment. During this internship, you’ll have the chance to work closely with experienced analysts, gaining mentorship and developing the skills needed to be well-prepared for a potential Business Analyst full-time role with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Where you&#39;ll make an impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt; – Optimize the backbone of our operations, from fulfillment centers to last-mile delivery and demand forecasting across Europe. Think: automating international delivery forecasts for growth areas like Munich.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer &lt;/strong&gt;– Drive growth through pricing, effective supplier relationships, and our market strategy. Think: Shaping our successful market entry into new cities. Your decisions shape how millions of customers experience Picnic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Picnic&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow as we grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;From day one, you’ll take ownership of real business projects that affect millions of customers, gaining hands-on experience while managing your studies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn from top minds. &lt;/strong&gt;Work alongside driven, talented mentors in a high-energy environment. You&#39;ll build, solve problems, and celebrate together, from our legendary Friday drinks to team events and parties.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career.&lt;/strong&gt; Earn a competitive student salary with flexible working hours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day. Curious about the questions?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status quo and rethinking how things are done. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled in a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s program&lt;/strong&gt; in a quantitative field (e.g., Industrial Engineering, Data Science &amp;amp; Management, Information Systems, Econometrics, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for data analytics and business consulting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your communication skills allow you to convert abstract plans into digestible information for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in both verbal and written English, German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an EU citizenship available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability: At least&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;6+ months for a regular internship or a thesis internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your performance, we can discuss further opportunities for a full-time role at Picnic!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enjoy a fresh daily lunch at the office, plus a selection of snacks and coffee to keep you energized.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials. &lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;competitive salary for a full-time internship, plus 15 vacation days based on a 6-month internship, so you can recharge&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/IcFUm-OCiZ0?si=FLIIpdXXsTojP4i4&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As our UX researcher, you will work collaboratively with Data Analysts, Product Owners, and Designers to develop the full user experience of Picnic’s products. With an open personality, you’re able to empathize with end-users on a weekly basis, whether that’s by guiding users through prototypes or investigating a new topic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Half of the week, you initiate, plan and execute hands-on research activities. The other half is used to observe and analyse user behaviour and communicate those insights effectively to various teams and stakeholders. You experiment with research approaches to answer important questions. How can we make in-app customer service more accessible?&amp;nbsp; How do customers decide what to eat?&amp;nbsp; How can we make delivering our groceries safer for our runners? Every week presents new challenges to explore, frame and evaluate. Understanding both the big picture and the details, you examine insights from unique angles to bring a deeper understanding of customer experience and provide testable hypotheses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of research activities to bring deep level insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; exploring:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide new hypotheses to test and explore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with designers and test prototypes on a weekly basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Document sessions and present actionable insights to both consumer-facing and employee-facing teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Be the face of Picnic and engage with customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Strive for continuous improvement to take our UX team to the next level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;MSc. degree in a relevant field, such as Industrial Design, Human Computer Interaction Design or Product Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;0-3 years of experience as UX Researcher &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing end-to-end product thinking, solving real problems for real people at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Analytical eye: You’re not a data wizard, but you’re familiar with Excel and know how to visualise and interpret data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to reason on high level about various topics, to quickly understand and discuss both business and technical concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellent communicator: You know how to strike up a conversation with anyone and know how to present insights succinctly&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Flexibility: Agile approach and ability to learn on the go&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Creativity: Outside-the box thinking and passion for details&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Affinity for or previous experience with digital design is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fluency in both Dutch and English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Open and available to work on-site fulltime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;In een notendop&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic bezorgen we dagelijks boodschappen bij 45.000 gezinnen met een vloot van 1800 elektrische voertuigen (onze &#39;EPV&#39;s&#39;). Voor onze floot zijn we op zoek naar een Wagenparkbeheerder of &lt;em&gt;&#39;Fleet Operator&#39;&lt;/em&gt; !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Wagenparkbeheerder of &lt;em&gt;&#39;Fleet Operator&#39;&lt;/em&gt; speel je een cruciale rol om dit mogelijk te maken. Je maakt direct impact door te werken aan verbeterprojecten om onze processen zo efficiënt mogelijk te maken en door veranderingen in last mile delivery processen te beheren. Elke dag maak je verschil bij Picnic!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wil jij deel uitmaken van het team dat zorgt voor een vlekkeloze bezorging bij onze klanten?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;De kunst van het vak&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betrouwbare partner: &lt;/strong&gt;Je bent het aanspreekpunt voor diverse Picnic-teams als het gaat om vragen en advies over ons wagenpark van EPV’s.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administratie &amp;amp; financiën: &lt;/strong&gt;Je bent verantwoordelijk voor het voertuigbeheer, houdt alles georganiseerd en zorgt ervoor dat elke offerte en factuur klopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholdermanagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Je bent de schakel tussen onze Hubs (last-mile-locaties) en onze servicepartners, waarbij je een effectieve en vlotte samenwerking garandeert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinatie: &lt;/strong&gt;Je schakelt met interne teams en servicepartners om de gezondheid en inzetbaarheid van de vloot te waarborgen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projectmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Je ontwikkelt en implementeert projecten om onze Last-Mile operatie te verbeteren en zo continue verbetering en operationele uitmuntendheid binnen Picnic te stimuleren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Over jou…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HBO werk- en denkniveau&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ jaar werk ervaring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent vloeiend in Nederlands en Engels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent in het bezit van een rijbewijs B&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt ervaring met Excel, Google Sheets en PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent 32-40 uur beschikbaar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Verse lunch, koffie en snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Op kantoor hebben we een koffiebar met eigen barista&#39;s, chefs die dagelijks een heerlijke, verse lunch bereiden en snacks en fruit zodat je energie op pijl blijft!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚵🏼Korting op zorgverzekering &amp;amp; fietsenplan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We werken samen met zorgverzekeraar CZ, waardoor Picnic-medewerkers een korting van 5% tot 15% krijgen op CZ-verzekeringspakketten. Bovendien kun je via onze samenwerking met Lease a Bike voordelig een nieuwe (e-)fiets leasen, die je later zelfs kunt overnemen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je alle ruimte om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen. We bieden persoonlijke groeikansen met een Leadership Bootcamp. Werk je liever aan je mentale welzijn? Via OpenUp krijg je gratis toegang tot professionele psychologen en diverse trainingen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En verder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij Picnic krijg je 25 vakantiedagen, een vergoeding voor je reiskosten en een pensioenregeling. Ook zorgen we voor een telefoon en laptop!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for an exciting part-time job alongside your studies? Want to apply analytical theory to high-impact, real-world business projects?&amp;nbsp;Take on the challenge and apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Analyst Working Student&lt;/strong&gt; at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This role is all about driving impact—you’ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that push boundaries and redefine the grocery shopping experience. You’ll join a dynamic and collaborative team in a fast-paced, innovative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day. Curious about the questions?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status quo and rethinking how things are done. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s program&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Aerospace, Mechanical, Industrial, Automation or Production Engineering; Mathematics; Econometrics; AI; or equivalent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for &lt;strong&gt;data analytics and business consulting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to explain &lt;strong&gt;complex analytical concepts&lt;/strong&gt; in a comprehensible manner to various stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; or are excited to learn&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in both written and verbal &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and have an &lt;strong&gt;EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt; available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for minimum &lt;strong&gt;16h per week&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;minimum 4 months&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your performance, we can discuss further opportunities at Picnic!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Where you can make an impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt; – Optimize the backbone of our operations, from fulfillment centers to last-mile delivery and demand forecasting across Europe. Think: automating international delivery forecasts for growth markets like France.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech&lt;/strong&gt; – Build scalable backend systems, cutting-edge AI workflows, and internal tooling that power our entire platform. Think: building AI agent workflows (using Python, Claude, and SQL).&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer&lt;/strong&gt; – Drive customer growth and strategic category development across our markets. Think: optimizing search algorithms for recipe discovery and running deep-dive analyses on customer retention and membership strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Picnic&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow as we grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;From day one, you’ll take ownership of real business projects that affect millions of customers, gaining hands-on experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn from top minds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work alongside driven, talented mentors in a high-energy environment. You&#39;ll build, solve problems, and celebrate together, from our legendary Friday drinks to team events and parties.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career.&lt;/strong&gt; Earn a competitive student salary with flexible working hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll have plenty of chances to grow, whether it’s through our casual Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions or team specific trainings. We’re especially keen on keeping great talent around: perform well as a working student, and we would love to explore&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;transitioning you into a full-time role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials. &lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

